The date picker component uses flowbite.
[Here's](https://flowbite.com/docs/getting-started/quickstart/) a guide to install it.

Don't forget to setup the primary color on tailwind's config, so flowbite picks it up.

```js
const colors = require("tailwindcss/colors");

module.exports = {
  theme: {
    extend: {
      colors: {
        primary: colors.indigo,
      },
    },
  },
};
```

